Output docs/demo.gif

Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1600
Set Height 900
Set Shell "zsh"
Set TypingSpeed 155

Type "gcode"
Enter

Sleep 2s

Type "/help"
Enter

Sleep 2.5s

Type "/models"
Enter

Sleep 2.5s

Type "/model hy3/tencent:free"
Enter

Sleep 2s

Type "Create a Python script that prints 'Hello from GCode'."
Enter

# let the Rich UI stream, write_file tool appears
Sleep 5s

Type "Update it so it asks for the user's name before greeting them."
Enter

# edit_file streams
Sleep 5s

Type "Show me the file and check git status."
Enter

Sleep 5s

Type "Run it."
Enter

# Permission dialog appears
Sleep 2s

Type "y"
Enter

Sleep 4s

Type "Delete demo.py."
Enter

Sleep 2s

Type "n"
Enter

Sleep 3s

Type "/history"
Enter

Sleep 2.5s

Type "/clear"
Enter

Sleep 1s

Type "/quit"
Enter

Sleep 3s